  "html": "\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/skill_newbie/images/spot_back_top.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"25\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"630\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Ultima \n            Online Of Forg</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>&nbsp;<img align=\"right\" border=\"0\" height=\"65\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/guidemenu.gif\" width=\"150\"></b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">초보자 \n            메뉴얼 (계정생성)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">울티마온라인을 \n            하기 위해서는 우선 신규코드를 구입하셔야 합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">현재 \n            패키지는 ML(몬데인레가시)이고 해당 패키지를 구입하셔야 합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"white\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"560\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"624\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">최신 \n                        패키지를 사서 신규계정을 만드시는게 유리합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이전 \n                        패키지로는 갈 수 없는 던전과 아이템등이 최신 패키지에서는 \n                        가능하기 때문입니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/warrior/point.gif\" width=\"15\"></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">계정생성순서 \n            : 계정사이트로 이동합니다. <b><a href=\"https://account.ea.com/myacct/uo/uo-hub.jsp?skin=uo\" target=\"_blank\">Click!!</a></b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/warrior/point.gif\" width=\"15\">Created \n            an Account</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">CREATE \n            ACCT의 버튼을 누릅니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/warrior/point.gif\" width=\"15\">Don't \n            have an EA member account?</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">울온 \n            계정을 생성하기 위해서는 일단 ea계정을 만드셔야 합니다. 울온이 ea사에 \n            속해있기 \n             때문에</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">해당 \n            ea에 멤버로 먼저 가입하셔야 합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/warrior/point.gif\" width=\"15\">계정생성 \n            상세사항</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><img border=\"1\" height=\"583\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/account/1.jpg\" width=\"577\"></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">복잡해보이지만 \n            순서대로 기입하시면 됩니다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">멤버네임에는 \n            자신의 계정명 (예:forgworld)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">패스워드에는 \n            4-16자사이로 동일한 이용하실 동일한 비밀번호를 입력</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">아래 \n            이메일주소는 자신의 이메일주소</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">그아래에는 \n            생년월일 달,일,년 순서대로 기입</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">젠더에는 \n            남자,여자 체크를 하시고</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">국가선택</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">우편번호 \n            선택을 하신 후 다음으로 넘어가시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/warrior/point.gif\" width=\"15\">신규계정 \n            코드입력</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><img border=\"1\" height=\"259\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/account/2.jpg\" width=\"582\"></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">받으신 \n            신규계정 코드를 - 포함해서 입력 시킵니다. 코드가 정상적이라면 약관동의사항으로 \n            넘어가게되며</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">에러가 \n            나시면 구입처에 문의하시길 바랍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/warrior/point.gif\" width=\"15\">약관동의사항(Terms \n            and Conditions+Rules Of Conduct)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">장문의 \n            약관이 계속 나열되어 있는것을 스크롤바로 쭉 내리시면 Aceept버튼이 \n            있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">동의하시면 \n            Accept버튼을 누르시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">또 \n            규범사항에 동의를 하셔야 합니다. 동의하시면 Accept버튼을 누르시면 \n            됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"white\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"560\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"624\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">다음페이지는 \n                        바로 신규계정이 완료되었으므로 게임타임이나 카드결제로 \n                        정액요금을 납부</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">하는 \n                        단계로 넘어가게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 \n                        여기까지 신규계정으로만 생성시킨 후 맨 첫단계에서 </span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Created \n                        an Account옆의 Edit Acct</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">버튼을 \n                        누르시면 계정 편집에서 쿠폰이나 카드로 나중에 결제하실 \n                        수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">주의할점은 \n                        정액요금을 납부하지 않으시면 신규계정 생성만으로 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">울온 \n                        플레이를 하실 수 없게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/warrior/point.gif\" width=\"15\">정액요금선택(Payment)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><img border=\"1\" height=\"130\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/account/3.jpg\" width=\"579\"></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">첫번째는 \n            신용카드로 지불 하는것으로 지불정지까지 계속해서 돈이 빠져나가게 \n            됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">두번째는 \n            게임타임쿠폰으로 3개월정액코드를 구입 코드를 입력하시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">게임타임쿠폰은 \n            cjmall,우리홈쇼핑등에서 구입하시면 편리합니다. 핸드폰으로 \n            바로 코드문자가 옵니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><img border=\"1\" height=\"278\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/account/4.jpg\" width=\"584\"></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">신용카드는 \n            결제가 3가지가 있는데 1개월,2개월,3개월씩입니다. 물론 신규계정을 \n            만들고 정액을</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">결제하시면 \n            1개월 보너스 추가가 됩니다. 게임타임쿠폰으로 3개월 결제하신분도 \n            동일합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">즉 \n            120일 동안 이용하실 수 있게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/warrior/point.gif\" width=\"15\">개인정보상세사항</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><img border=\"1\" height=\"308\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/account/5.jpg\" width=\"576\"></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">개인정보 \n            상세사항을 입력 하시면 완료됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"95%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_newbie/newbie_guide/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/menu.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"295\">\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"#top\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_newbie/images/top.gif\" width=\"20\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:30; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:30;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\">Written \n            By Forg</font></span></b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/skill_newbie/images/spot_back_bottom.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"25\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"630\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
